# Direction

The single channel. The loop agent reads this page at the start of every
iteration. Anything said anywhere else (chat, intercom, commit messages,
Discord) is not an order until it is written here by Joel or a director
running with `CINEMA_ROLE=director`.

Entries are dated, newest first, and stay short. An entry is one of:
`standing` (applies until replaced), `lane` (what to work on now), or
`note` (context, no action).

